<title>RUSSIA: Russia's Unikombank 95 pre-tax rises to 460 bn rls.</title>
<headline>Russia's Unikombank 95 pre-tax rises to 460 bn rls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>					1995		  1994</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		460.22 bln rbls   357.54 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Assets			    3.18 trln	   2.04 trln</p>
<p>    Charter capital		25.00 bln	   12.00 bln</p>
<p>Dividends</p>
<p>    ordinary			 750		   n/a</p>
<p>    preferred			7,500		 n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name Universalny Aktsionerny Kommerchesky Bank Unikombank. Coopers &amp; Lybrand audited the bank to Russian accounting standards.</p>
<p>The central bank has recently released Unikombank from temporary management imposed after the bank failed to pay some of its clients.</p>
<p>--Alexei Pankratov, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
